<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore Jan Asian dollar assets up 8.6 pct on yr.</title>
<headline>Singapore Jan Asian dollar assets up 8.6 pct on yr.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asian dollar market.</p>
<p>		    (billions of U.S. dollars)</p>
<p>					  Jan 97     Dec 96   Jan 96</p>
<p>Total assets &amp; liabilities</p>
<p>of the Singapore-based</p>
<p> Asian dollar market		519.28     506.87   478.21</p>
<p>Loans to non-bank</p>
<p> customers			    178.77     180.51   170.25</p>
<p> Interbank loans		    289.86     278.74   261.06</p>
<p>The Monetary Authority of Singapore (MAS) said total assets and liabilities of the Asian dollar market rose 8.6 percent year-on-year in January.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
